        "content": "### 2.1 Resolve current tasks\n\nResolve Versioned Review Tasks calls the versioned SQL function. Resolve current tasks; cancel older tasks; retain history. Repeated identical events are safe. Late tasks cannot reopen an already reviewed version.",
